          "description": "Tender Tales explore the everyday emotions and challenges children face. Whether it's a boy who drops his ice cream cone, a child reluctant to go to school, or a girl upset over a slightly bruised banana, I hope that your child sees themselves—human, resilient, deserving of empathy and grace—in these stories. If your child enjoys these stories, learn more about Tender Tales in Yoto Space. Tender Tales are inclusive stories that value every child and every family 🌈",
